      "messageId": "commission-2021-01",
      "speakerId": "luoyao",
      "text": "图书馆的书我今天就留在这里。后面的事呢？",
      "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
    },
    {
      "messageId": "commission-2021-02",
      "speakerId": "owner",
      "text": "依照之前商定的方式留契。但有一点需要再次提醒你，留契不等于归籍。",
      "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
    },
    {
      "messageId": "commission-2021-03",
      "speakerId": "luoyao",
      "text": "我知道。最后还是得由他自己选择。",
      "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
    },
    {
      "messageId": "commission-2021-04",
      "speakerId": "owner",
      "text": "是的，任何人都不能替他完成。",
      "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
    },
    {
      "messageId": "commission-2021-05",
      "speakerId": "luoyao",
      "text": "那就等他自己决定吧。",
      "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
    },
    {
      "messageId": "commission-2021-06",
      "speakerId": "owner",
      "text": "还有什么需要交代的吗？",
      "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
    },
    {
      "messageId": "commission-2021-07",
      "speakerId": "luoyao",
      "text": "没有了。谢谢您。",
      "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
    },
    {
      "messageId": "commission-2021-08",
      "speakerId": "luoyao",
      "text": "如果以后他真的追查到了这里，来问这些事……希望您能好好告诉他。",
